msgid ""
"Where the object's origin goes in that scene, as a location (``[[x, y, "
"z], [axis x, axis y, axis z], angle]``, in millimetres and degrees). It "
"is stated here rather than in the scene because it is a fact about *this*"
" object -- where its origin sits relative to the floor it is meant to "
"stand on -- and the scene is shared. The blocks of ``feature_simulate`` "
"are drawn about their own centres, so each stack is lifted 10 mm to stand"
" on the floor; ``buoy`` is also turned 60 degrees, to be released tilted."
msgstr ""

