#~ msgid ""
#~ "A bare ``type: world`` resolves to "
#~ "nothing and says so. So does ``pc"
#~ " export -t mjcf``: nothing in "
#~ "``//builtin/export`` writes either format, and"
#~ " the qualified spelling is what "
#~ "reaches the package that does."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Un simple ``type: world`` no se "
#~ "resuelve a nada y lo indica. Lo"
#~ " mismo ocurre con ``pc export -t "
#~ "mjcf``: nada en ``//builtin/export`` escribe"
#~ " ninguno de los dos formatos, y "
#~ "la grafía cualificada es la que "
